  <h2>Launching Fast in the Social Era</h2>
  <p>The US and UK markets are increasingly driven by micro-communities. As a <strong>Supply Chain Partner</strong>, we have developed a specific "Speed-to-Market" track for influencer-led brands.</p>

  <h3>Agile Inventory Management</h3>
  <p>We allow you to test 3-5 unique designs with MOQs as low as 100 PCS. This reduces your initial capital risk and allows you to use real-time sales data to decide which styles to ramp up for high-volume <strong>Inventory Management</strong>.</p>

  <h3>Viral-Ready Logistics</h3>
  <p>When a style goes viral, you need to restock fast. Our <strong>Global Logistics</strong> partners offer express air-freight solutions that can get your best-sellers from our factory to your US warehouse in 5-7 days, ensuring you never miss a sales wave.</p>
